Description: highly customizable Wayland bar for Sway and wlroots based compositors
 Waybar is a highly customizable Wayland bar for Sway and wlroots based
 compositors. It provides applets displaying information about the compositor
 (workspaces, binding mode, focused window name), the system (clock, battery,
 network, sound volume, memory, CPU load, disk usage, backlight, temperature)
 and many other sources through built-in modules and custom scripts.
 .
 Configuration is a JSONC file with CSS styling, both user-editable, so the bar
 can be adapted to any desktop layout. The package includes the Sway,
 Hyprland, River, dwl, Niri, Mango and Umbriel workspace modules, the tray,
 MPRIS, MPD, PulseAudio, PipeWire, WirePlumber, JACK, sndio, UPower, libinput,
 evdev, RFKILL, WWAN, GPS and logind integrations.
